    {
      "id": "row-1",
      "x": -380,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 320,
      "text": "Wallet home (F1, F4)\nThe balance comes from a whole-kobo integer. Offline: banner on top, available = balance − pending, and Pending / Failed chips with icon + word.",
      "page": "page-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "row-2",
      "x": -380,
      "y": 1000,
      "w": 320,
      "text": "Send Money (F2, F4)\nRecipient → Amount → Confirm. The reference on Confirm comes from the idempotency key made once per attempt. Sent and Queued are the two possible outcomes.",
      "page": "page-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "row-3",
      "x": -380,
      "y": 2000,
      "w": 320,
      "text": "NovaSave (F3, F4)\nProgress % uses whole-number maths (saved × 100 ÷ target). Pending contributions are drawn separately and not counted as saved.",
      "page": "page-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "row-4",
      "x": -380,
      "y": 3000,
      "w": 320,
      "text": "Errors & accessibility (C3)\nInline errors disable Continue. Failed syncs are never retried automatically. The 200% text screens show content reflowing instead of clipping.",
      "page": "page-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "spec-source",
      "x": 0,
